1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,133
There's one more place. The hospital
on the far side of the river. The only
way across is a bridge that's half
collapsed.

2
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:10,033
I knew it was a bad idea. I went
anyway.

3
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:16,100
Halfway across, a rusted beam bends
under your boot. Below you, a hundred
feet of black water.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,367
Nope.

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,200
If I fall, no one knows. Not one
person on earth. No ambulance. No hand
to grab.

6
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,467
You step back. Slowly. Your hands are
shaking.

7
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:34,400
Rule eleven. Never take a risk you
can't walk away from. Alone, every
injury is a death sentence.
